Subject: [PATCH] plugin:CPER:Processed Add extension payload support

Implement PluginFactory::buildPayload() for the CPER Processed plugin.

The CPER Processed factory converts r untime metadata into the payload
stored under the
xyz.openbmc_project.Logging.Extension.CPER.Processed entry
within the _EXTENSIONS transport object.

Payload construction is exposed through the plugin
integration service, allowing runtime metadata providers
to remain independent of CPER Processed schema details.

This keeps CPER Processed-specific payload formatting and
schema ownership within the plugin implementation while
allowing log_manager to remain plugin agnostic.

Tested:
'''
Enabled:
  -Damd-event-log=enabled
  -Druntime-metadata-plugin=xyz.openbmc_project.Logging.Extension.CPER.Processed

busctl introspect xyz.openbmc_project.Logging \
  /xyz/openbmc_project/logging/entry/72

...
...

xyz.openbmc_project.Logging.Extension.CPER.Processed interface -         -
.DiagnosticDataType    property  s  "xyz.openbmc_project.Logging.CPER.Types.ContentType.CPER"
.NotificationType      property  s  ""
.Oem                   property  a{ss}
                              "AMD" :
                              "{\"AEL.AFID\":\"8\",\
\"AEL.FRU_LIST\":\"/xyz/openbmc_project/inventory/system/Board/XYZ\",\
\"AEL.VERSION\":\"1.0\"}"
.SectionType           property  s  ""

xyz.openbmc_project.Logging.Entry interface -         -
.AdditionalData        property  a{ss}
                              "SensorName" :
                              "BRB_L_VR_1_VOLT_V"
.Id                    property  u  72
.Message               property  s
                              "xyz.openbmc_project.Sensor.Threshold.ReadingAboveLowerCriticalThreshold"

...

busctl --json=pretty call xyz.openbmc_project.Logging \
  /xyz/openbmc_project/logging/entry/72 \
  org.freedesktop.DBus.Properties GetAll \
  s xyz.openbmc_project.Logging.Extension.CPER.Processed

{
    "DiagnosticDataType": {
        "data": "xyz.openbmc_project.Logging.CPER.Types.ContentType.CPER"
    },
    "NotificationType": {
        "data": ""
    },
    "SectionType": {
        "data": ""
    },
    "Oem": {
        "data": {
            "AMD": {
                "AEL.AFID": "8",
                "AEL.FRU_LIST":
                    "/xyz/openbmc_project/inventory/system/Board/XYZ",
                "AEL.VERSION": "1.0"
            }
        }
    }
}
'''

